* Coilcraft Part Number : LPZ4012-335
* Inductance = 3.3mH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-1MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
