X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=2100
+ R2=76
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000001
+ K2=310
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=44
+ K5=0.0000189
.ends LPZ4012-335_freq

